'''Goomy''' (Japanese: '''ヌメラ''' ''Numera'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

