==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Goomy|91}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion; both cards have the Sticky Membrane Ability and the Ram attack.
*'''Sticky Membrane''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Goomy|91}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

